# APO 1.5 - timer-driven ASCII donut, 20 frames/second, 3.2 seconds/revolution.
# Frames are pre-rendered; this is not yet a live trigonometric 3D renderer.
# Build: ./apo build examples/donut.apo -o out/donut
# Run: ./out/donut     Stop: Ctrl+C. Terminal: at least 64 x 24.

